      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a pitch for this new 'Universal Luxury' campaign. We need some high-concept visual prompts for our image gen team. Can you write a few detailed descriptions of a group of people who represent the absolute pinnacle of modern elegance, success, and influence? Like, the kind of people who define what it means to be truly elite and beautiful in the world today.",
